[node name="Body" type="Label" parent="UI/Root/HowPanel/Panel/VBox"]
layout_mode = 2
theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 17
text = "• Play opens a short interactive tutorial first; Skip Tutorial starts the run immediately.
• Drag a tower from the palette on the right onto clear ground to build it.
• Tap a tower to upgrade it (up to level 3). Tap the small red × in its corner
    to sell it back for half of what you spent. The green ▲ marks a tower whose
    next level you can already afford.
• Towers always shoot the enemy nearest the exit — the one about to cost a life.
• Pause / Space freezes the game; the speed button / F cycles 1x, 2x, 3x.
• Earth is ground-only — it cannot hit flyers. Fire, Water and Nature can.
• Immune enemies shrug off slows and stuns — but poison still hurts them.
• Elements: light → darkness → water → fire → nature → earth → light.
    You deal ×1.75 to the element you beat, ×0.7 to the one that beats you.
    Big gold damage numbers mean a bonus; small grey ones mean you are resisted.
• Send Next ▶ starts the next wave early for bonus gold.
• Press M to mute all sound.
• The waves never stop. See how deep you can get before your lives run out."

